        "data_flow": "Client applications send requests to the API Gateway, which delegates authentication to the Authentication Service before routing to backend microservices (User, Product, Order, Payment) that process requests via synchronous call chains and interact with a central PostgreSQL Database, Redis Cache, and Object Storage while exporting logs, metrics, and traces to an Observability component.",
